<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέρτερος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Comp. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνεροι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lower, of the nether world,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἵ περ ἐ. εἰσι θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.225
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνεροι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				285
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
					132
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦσθα ἐ. Οὐρανιώνων</span>
			<i>below</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.898
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>lower,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				44.164
			</span></i>.—After <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> usu. in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέρτερος</span>
			(q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέρτατον βένθος</span>”
				<i>lowest,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					35.3
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέρτατος.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
